        "name": "Hanamura Temple"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Malthael is a very versatile Hero that is excellent in many different maps. On a Pale Horse enhances Malthael's effectiveness in large maps, while his outstanding double soak makes him a good pick on Infernal Shrines, Sky Temple, and Towers of Doom. His good dueling capabilities can be abused on Dragon Shire and Tomb of the Spider Queen. Additionally, since Malthael can easily capture Mercenary Camps, due to his good self-sustain, he is good on macro-heavy maps, like Garden of Terror and Blackheart's Bay.\n\nMalthael cannot abuse his fast rotation and waveclear in 2-lane maps. Therefore, we do not recommend him on Hanamura Temple and Battlefield of Eternity."
  },
